    "description": {
      "value": "This ornately designed metal staff shines with precious inlays of gold. When you Cast a Spell from the staff, the illusory image of something you desire flashes across its surface.\n\nWhile wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to identify illusion magic.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **3rd** illusory disguise, item facade\n- **4th** illusory creature, veil"
